	(property "Description" "DNP: RECOM RACM06E minimum load is 0%, so no preload is fitted; footprint kept. Was Bourns 2512 thick-film 33 ohm 1%, 2 W at 70 C with 300 mm2 combined solder-pad/trace copper per datasheet; permanent 5 V minimum-load resistor, 0.677-0.844 W at 4.75-5.25 V including 1% tolerance. Reserve copper area and keep away from probes, precision meter components, antenna module and electrolytics. Revised module local ambient limit 50 C."
